  "title": "Slow Cooker Smoked Oxtail and Sweet Potato Stew",
  "description": "This recipe combines smoked oxtail and sweet potatoes with bell pepper, fire-roasted tomatoes, and spices in the slow cooker for a delicious, easy stew.",
  "authors": [
    "Kim"
  ],
